    "text": "On Cristes naman and Sanctus Petrus apostolus an gildscipe is gegaderod on Wudebiriglande, and se\nNu do\u00f0 hig \u00e6t \u00e6lcum heor\u00f0e to gecnawnisse \u00feam canonicon anne penig to eastron \u00e6lce geare.\nAnd ealswa \u00e6t \u00e6lcum for\u00f0farenum gildan \u00e6t \u00e6lcum heor\u00f0e \u00e6nne penig to sawul sceote, hit bonda si\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t sawulgesceot sceulon \u00fea canonicas habban, and swilce \u00feenisce don for hig swilce hig agon\nAnd \u00f0is sindon heora nama \u00fee beo\u00f0 on \u00feam gildscipe, Brihtwi, Wlno\u00f0, Ealdwine, Leofric, Brihtm\u00e6r,\nOn Wudebiriglande is eac an o\u00f0er gildscipe gegaderod criste and sancte Petre, and hig do\u00f0 to martinus\nAnd \u00e6lc sawulgesceot ealswa \u00e6t \u00e6lcum heor\u00f0e \u00e6nne penig.\nAnd \u00f0is sint \u00fe\u00e6ra manna nama, Kytel, \u00f0eodric, \u00f0urwurd, Ailno\u00fe, Ailmer, Wulmer, Ailric, Alfg\u00e6r,\nOf Colatunes gildscipe, Ordric preost, Alm\u00e6r, Ailwine, Alword, A\u00f0esta, Godric, Alg\u00e6r, Alfric,\nOf Clifttunes gildscipe, Isaac preost, Alm\u00e6r, Godwine, Alwine, Brihtric, Beorning, Hierding, \u00f0eodric\nOf Alwines gildscipe on Wudebirig, Alfstan, leowine, Alfric, Ailwine, A\u00f0elhild, Ailric, \u00f0ureword,\nOf Bridafordes gildscipe, Edwine, Wlfric, S\u00e6wine S\u00e6m\u00e6r, Edwine and Edwine, Alfric, Leofwine,\nOf Cliftwike, Wlatere preost, Edm\u00e6r, Leowine, S\u00e6no\u00f0, Swein, King, Ailword, Alg\u00e6r, S\u00e6ric, Edwi,\nOf \u00feam gildscipe on lege, Ailwine preost, Tyrri, preost, Willm, Alfred, Gosfr\u00e6g, Ailword, Edwine,\nOf Hnutwille, Godric, Alwine, Godwine, Godric, Wlfric, Alfric, Leofric, Dunewine, Alg\u00e6r, Edwine,\nOf Colatune, Alwine Tredda sunu, Godric, Ailric, and Beorn, Brihtm\u00e6r, Alm\u00e6r, Ordric, Dirwine,\nOf Sidemu\u00f0a, Algar, Ailric, Wlwine, Wnking, Ailm\u00e6r, Edwi, Brihtric, Alfric, Alwi, Luduwine,\nOf Halsforda Ilberd preost, Edwine, Alwine, Wlword, Limm\u00e6r, Ailm\u00e6r, Leofric, Edwine, Edwi and\nOf Hwitastane, Edzi, Godric, Edwine, Leowine, Aluric, Ealdwine, Alwine, S\u00e6wi, S\u00e6gar, Wlwi,\nOf Axamu\u00f0a, Godgi\u00f0, Esgar, Edrid, Ailward, Ailwine, Leowine, S\u00e6no\u00f0, Wiking, Herman, Edword,",
